<h3> Smoothing</h3>

The Smoothing Factor S is used as follows:

<p>X<sub>s</sub>(i)=(SX(i-1) + X(i) + S(i+1))/(1+2S)     i=2,3...(N-1)
<p>X<sub>s</sub>(1)=X(1)
<p>X<sub>s</sub>(N)=X(N)

<p>From:
<br>
K. Lowry and T. Johnson "Modifications to Iterative Recursion Unfolding Algorithms and Computer Codes to Find More Appropriate Neutron Spectra", Naval Research Laboratory, Washington, D.C.

